  "all_ingredients_flat": "mustard seeds, curry leaves, Ginger-Garlic-Chilly Paste, turmeric powder, potatoes, salt, cilantro, Green Teekhli Chutney, Instant Sweet Chutney, garlic powder, red chilly powder, Ezekiel 4:9 bread",
  "instructions": "MASALA PASTE: Heat a pan. Dry pop some mustard seeds. Add some curry leaves and roast. Add 1 Tbsp Ginger-Garlic-Chilly Paste. Cook and sprinkle some water as needed. Once cooked, add 1/2 tsp turmeric powder and give it a quick stir. POTATO MIXTURE: Boil 6 potatoes. Peel and mashed them roughly. Add Masala Paste, some salt (to taste) and 2 Tbsp chopped cilantro. Mix well. CHUTNEYS: Prepare Green Teekhli Chutney & Instant Sweet Chutney separately. SPICY GARLIC POWDER: Combine equal quantities of garlic powder and red chilly powder. Mix well. Also add some salt (to taste). ASSEMBLY: Toast an Ezekiel 4:9 bread. Layer with Green Teekhli Chutney first. Then spread some Potato Mixture. Drizzle some Instant Sweet Chutney. Then sprinkle Spicy Garlic Powder. Enjoy!",
